// M3 language-boundary negative (): external observation / evidence verification is a
// runtime concern owned by neutrino-network/neutrino-build-tools — it is NOT core translator
// source syntax ( non-goal). The frontend must reject `observe` / `verify` with
// "unexpected statement". See docs/language/LANGUAGE_BOUNDARY.md §3. Pinned by self-test [56].
procedure shipment_observation {
    input amount : money

    observe shipment from oracle
    verify evidence shipment
}
